# Claims to Avoid

1. Bagalāmukhī worship can scientifically paralyze another person.
2. All devotees approach her to harm enemies.
3. Her tongue image has one universally accepted meaning.
4. She originates securely in the Vedas.
5. Abhinavagupta directly explained her iconography.
6. Her temples were all founded in epic times.
7. Yellow has a scientifically proven immobilizing effect.
8. Internal psychological interpretations erase the historical coercive layer.

